  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• <p>• Preheat oven to 240°C/220°C fan-forced.<br>• Cut potato into bite-sized chunks.<br>• Place potato, Mumbai spice blend and brown mustard seeds on a lined oven tray. Drizzle with olive oil and toss to coat.<br>• Roast until tender, 20-25 minutes. </p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6874d6925a587f17f4588ebb/step-360b7800.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• Meanwhile, thinly slice cucumber into rounds. <br>• Thinly slice red radish.<br>• Grate carrot (see ingredients).<br>• Cut paneer into 1cm-thick slices. </p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6874d6925a587f17f4588ebb/step-c8ea7110.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• When potato has 5 minutes remaining, heat a large frying pan over medium-high heat with a drizzle of olive oil.<br>• Cook paneer until golden brown, 1-2 minutes each side.<br>• Remove pan from heat, then add sweet chilli sauce, turning paneer to coat. </p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6874d6925a587f17f4588ebb/step-ca34cc20.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• In a large bowl, combine mixed salad leaves, cucumber, radish, carrot and a drizzle of white wine vinegar and olive oil. Season with salt and pepper.<br>• Divide sweet chilli paneer, Bombay potatoes and cucumber salad between plates.<br>• Sprinkle over crushed peanuts and serve with garlic aioli. Enjoy! </p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6874d6925a587f17f4588ebb/step-aca9bb30.jpg"
    }
  ]
